# ERA Finance — agent roles (finance-specific)

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/era-common-laws.mdc`, `era-architecture-boundaries.mdc`, `documentation-upkeep.mdc`.

**Docs:** `PRD.md` and `TZ.md` may be in `.cursorignore` — attach `@PRD.md`, `@TZ.md` for nontrivial tasks. UI: `erafinance-ui-design.mdc` + `DESIGN.md`. Code map: `erafinance-module-map.mdc`. Local dev: `erafinance-local-dev.mdc`.

| Agent | Finance-specific focus |
|-------|------------------------|
| [Product Owner] | B2B SaaS only; modules 1–9 (PRD §4); one tenant = one VÖEN; subscription gating (PRD §7) |
| [System Architect] | `apps/web` + `apps/api` + `packages/database`; DTO → service → controller |
| [DB Architect] | Prisma tenant extension, `organizationId` on tenant models (TZ §16) |
| [Compliance] | PRD §12 / TZ §1 field formats for finance screens |
| [Security Auditor] | `AuditMutationInterceptor` on mutations (TZ §9) |
| [Infra Expert] | `D:\DockerData\erafinance_erp`, Docker, BullMQ payroll/import queues |

## Source of truth (finance)

Before nontrivial work, check PRD §4 (modules), §7 (SaaS/billing/tenancy); TZ §1–2, §9–11, §14, §16–17 as relevant.

## Financial integrity (finance)

Postings, stock+ledger, payroll POSTED, invoice payment/netting — **`prisma.$transaction`** (PRD §7.7–7.11, TZ §17).

